---
// Wrapper for long-form text pages (privacy notice, allergen information).
// Styles the plain HTML inside it, so the pages can be written as simple
// <h2>/<p>/<ul> without classes on every element.
//
// [&_h2]:mt-10 means "every h2 inside me gets mt-10". It's Tailwind's syntax
// for styling descendants from the parent, the same as the CSS selector
// `.this-element h2 { … }`.
---

<div
	class="mx-auto max-w-180 px-5 pb-15 [&_a]:text-rose [&_a]:underline [&_a]:underline-offset-4 [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_h2]:text-xl [&_li]:mb-1 [&_p]:mb-4 [&_p]:leading-loose [&_p]:text-ink-soft [&_ul]:mb-4 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-5 [&_ul]:leading-loose [&_ul]:text-ink-soft"
>
	<slot />
</div>
